 &#x02013; Experience with 7 cases</article-title><source>J Korean Med Sci</source><year>1992</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>258</fpage><lpage>263</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1285925</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Sohn</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>KC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hwang</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Organo-axial volvulus of the stomach with diaphragmatic eventration</article-title><source>Korean J Intern Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>127</fpage><lpage>130</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10992725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jayanthi</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Vidyanathan</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Mathai</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Muthusami</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Jesudason</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Traumatic eventration of diaphragm complicated by mesenteroaxial volvulus of the stomach</article-title><source>Trop Gastroenterol</source><year>1994</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>169</fpage><lpage>172</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7863554</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Llaneza</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name><name><surname>Salt</surname><given-names>WB</given-names><suffix>2nd</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Gastric volvulus. More common than previously thought?</article-title><source>Postgrad Med</source><year>1986</year><volume>80</volume><fpage>279</fpage><lpage>283</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3763530</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cancrini</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bellotti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Santoro</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Stanzani</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ascenzi</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Cancrini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Diaphragmatic eventration in the adult: Repair with GoreTex surgical mesh</article-title><source>G Chir</source><year>1998</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>39</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9567494</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kizilcan</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanyel</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hiesomez</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The long term results of diaphragmatic plication</article-title><source>J Pediatr Surg</source><year>1993</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>42</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8429469</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0022-3468(05)80351-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tsang</surname><given-names>TK</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Endoscopic reduction of gastric volvulus: the alpha-loop maneuver</article-title><sour